	optdepends = authbind: only needed when the web UI serves on a port below 1024 (the default is port 80); use `pipedalconfig --install --port 8080` to avoid it (AUR)
	optdepends = networkmanager: Wi-Fi hotspot and P2P session features
	optdepends = lv2: use third-party LV2 effects plugins in addition to the ToobAmp set (from toobamp-bin)
